OL,3,GNEWSATwo more officers arrested in
OL,4,APolice Federation fraud investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour more people, including two serving
OL,7,Fpolice officers, have been arrested as
OL,8,Fpart of an investigation into suspected
OL,9,Ffraud and bribery at the Police
OL,10,FFederation of England and Wales.
OL,12,FTwo men and two women were arrested at
OL,13,Fthe federation's offices in
OL,14,FLeatherhead, Surrey, on Tuesday. The
OL,15,Fwomen are both in their 50s and the men
OL,16,Fin their 40s and 50s.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
