OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwo more officers arrested in
OL,4,APolice Federation fraud investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe City of London Police's corruption
OL,7,Funit, which leads on fraud
OL,8,Finvestigations, said all four suspects
OL,9,Fhad been taken to a police station for
OL,10,Fquestioning. It comes after three
OL,11,Farrests connected to the same case were
OL,12,Fmade in March.
OL,14,FThe Police Federation represents more
OL,15,Fthan 145,000 rank-and-file officers, up
OL,16,Fto and including the rank of chief
OL,17,Finspector as well as special
OL,18,Fconstables.
